{"_id":"1cs0OhEGb5b5ROwp","name":"Robot","type":"class","img":"modules/fvtt_mosh_1e_psg/icons/armor/standard_battle_dress.png","system":{"description":"<p>Out on the Rim, many old model mechanical automatons are still in service, the new human-like androids being too expensive or untrusted. Their toughness is testament to their original functions, but their old model logic cores are not sophisticated and they are far past their warranty expiration. Robots don't need to breathe or wear vaccsuits.</p>","source":"Rimward Classes","author":"mechanoid23","link":"https://github.com/mechanoid23/fvtt_mosh_1e_rwc","trauma_response":"WHEN YOU GAIN A WOUND, ALSO LOSE 1D10 FROM A STAT OR SAVE","robotic":true,"common_skills":["Compendium.fvtt_mosh_1e_psg.items_skills_1e.Item.e1rHSbZrEDFkjizS","Compendium.fvtt_mosh_1e_psg.items_skills_1e.Item.WRGCkrN7TLSvW9Ls","Compendium.fvtt_mosh_1e_psg.items_skills_1e.Item.9vkt2RBybSeuHoQQ","Compendium.fvtt_mosh_1e_psg.items_skills_1e.Item.rUu3BXzcG5NsUSCD","Compendium.fvtt_mosh_1e_psg.items_skills_1e.Item.lYEj5y8Kwkvumch3","Compendium.fvtt_mosh_1e_psg.items_skills_1e.Item.6nj5wEZ8JPTCu4DQ","Compendium.fvtt_mosh_1e_psg.items_skills_1e.Item.Wu1j9XsVNjRW7OlM","Compendium.fvtt_mosh_1e_psg.items_skills_1e.Item.ACtRFMZC05EnUSce","Compendium.fvtt_mosh_1e_psg.items_skills_1e.Item.vNa4htmpXawfccpN","Compendium.fvtt_mosh_1e_psg.items_skills_1e.Item.30dSaZxJc40A9V5r","Compendium.fvtt_mosh_1e_psg.items_skills_1e.Item.41CEH7dOvmTaywpD","Compendium.fvtt_mosh_1e_psg.items_skills_1e.Item.erO6jxrvrF94Fl3g","Compendium.fvtt_mosh_1e_psg.items_skills_1e.Item.2uTOrNHnq9KhPXxD"],"base_adjustment":{"strength":30,"speed":-10,"intellect":-10,"combat":0,"sanity":0,"fear":60,"body":0,"max_wounds":2,"skills_granted":["Compendium.fvtt_mosh_1e_psg.items_skills_1e.Item.e1rHSbZrEDFkjizS","Compendium.fvtt_mosh_1e_psg.items_skills_1e.Item.WRGCkrN7TLSvW9Ls","Compendium.fvtt_mosh_1e_psg.items_skills_1e.Item.9vkt2RBybSeuHoQQ"]},"selected_adjustment":{"choose_stat":[],"choose_ski